  "description": "When Lily became the princess's maid due to their uncanny resemblance, she never thought she would one day be forced to impersonate royalty and marry a prince! What was supposed to be a one-time farce quickly spirals out of control, forcing her to leave behind everything she knows and plunging her into a world of secrets and schemes. As she finds herself at the center of a fierce power struggle between princes, Lily must decide what's more important to her — her identity or her life.\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
